INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jnealey-godaddy/designsetgo/lint', 'lint', 'jnealey-godaddy', 'designsetgo', 'community', 'lint jnealey-godaddy designsetgo community block-editor blocks gutenberg gutenberg-blocks page-builder wordpress wordpress-blocks wordpress-development wordpress-plugin The lint skill checks JavaScript, CSS, and PHP files for code quality and standards compliance, benefiting WordPress developers. It provides commands for auto-fixing issues and running all linters. Lint 是一个代码质量检查工具，支持检查 JavaScript、CSS 和 PHP 代码。 Lint はコード品質チェックツールで、JavaScript、CSS、PHP コードをチェックします。 Lint는 코드 품질 관리를 위한 도구로 JavaScript, CSS, PHP 코드를 체크 Lint es una herramienta para mejorar la calidad del código en proyectos WordPress. Permite comprobar y corregir errores en JavaScript, CSS y PHP Lint est un outil pour améliorer la qualité du code dans les projets WordPress. Il permet de vérifier et de corriger les erreurs en JavaScript, CSS et PHP Lint ist ein Tool zur Verbesserung der Code-Qualität in WordPress-Projekten. Es ermöglicht die Überprüfung und Korrektur von Fehlern in JavaScript, CSS und PHP O Lint é uma ferramenta de verificação de código que ajuda a garantir a qualidade e a conformidade com os padrões de codificação Lint - это инструмент проверки кода, помогающий обеспечить качество и соответствие кодированию стандартам Lint هو أداة فحص شفرة تساعد على ضمان جودة الشفرة وامتثالها لمعايير البرمجة how to use lint what is lint lint alternative lint vs eslint lint install lint setup guide wordpress linting javascript linting php linting 代码质量检查 Lint工具 JavaScript代码检查 CSS代码检查 PHP代码检查 代码标准合规 自动修复功能 Runs lint commands for JavaScript using npm run lint:js Auto-fixes JavaScript issues with npm run lint:js -- --fix Checks CSS/SCSS files for quality and standards compliance with npm run lint:css Supports PHP linting using WordPress Coding Standards with npm run lint:php Allows running all linters with a single command: npm run lint:js && npm run lint:css && npm run lint:php lint is a code analysis tool that checks JavaScript, CSS, and PHP files for quality and standards compliance');
