い機能を開発すること","ko":"기능 구현이란 Spec Driven Development 워크플로우를 사용하여 새로운 기능을 개발하는 것","es":"La implementación de características con SDD es un enfoque de desarrollo que sigue un flujo de trabajo estricto para garantizar la calidad del código.","fr":"La mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités avec SDD est une approche de développement qui suit un flux de travail strict pour assurer la qualité du code.","de":"Das Implementieren von Funktionen mit SDD ist ein Entwicklungsansatz, der einen strengen Arbeitsfluss befolgt, um die Qualität des Codes zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Implementação de recurso é o processo de desenvolver funcionalidades com Spec Driven Development","ru":"Реализация функций - это процесс разработки функциональностей с помощью SDD","ar":"تنفيذ ميزة هو عملية تطوير الوظائف باستخدام SDD"},"features":{"en":["Reads relevant issues using gh issue view $ARGUMENTS","Examines related models in app/models/","Reviews existing specs for similar features in spec/","Checks config/routes.rb for existing routes","Utilizes available factories in spec/factories/"],"zh":["遵循Spec Driven Development工作流","探索代码库","阅读相关模型","阅读existing specs","检查config/routes.rb","检查spec/factories/"],"ja":["Spec Driven Developmentワークフローに従う","コードベースの探索","関連モデルの読み方","既存のspecの読み方","config/routes.rbの確認","spec/factories/の確認"],"ko":["Spec Driven Development 워크플로우를 따르기","코드베이스 탐색","관련 모델 읽기","기존 spec 읽기","config/routes.rb 확인","spec/factories/ 확인"],"es":["Seguir el flujo de trabajo de Spec Driven Development","Leer el código relevante antes de escribir specs","Utilizar herramientas como gh issue view y spec/factories","Verificar config/routes.rb y spec/factories","Escribir specs efectivas para características similares"],"fr":["Suivre le flux de travail de Spec Driven Development","Lire le code pertinent avant d''écrire des specs","Utiliser des outils tels que gh issue view et spec/factories","Vérifier config/routes.rb et spec/factories","Écrire des specs efficaces pour des fonctionnalités similaires"],"de":["Befolgen des Arbeitsflusses von Spec Driven Development","Lesen des relevanten Codes vor dem Schreiben von Specs","Verwenden von Tools wie gh issue view und spec/factories","Überprüfen von config/routes.rb und spec/factories","Schreiben von effektiven Specs für ähnliche Funktionen"],"pt":["Leitura do código antes da escrita","Análise de modelos em app/models/","Verificação de rotas em config/routes.rb","Uso de fábricas em spec/factories/","Seguimento estrito do workflow SDD"],"ru":["Изучение кода перед написанием","Анализ моделей в app/models/","Проверка маршрутов в config/routes.rb","Использование факторий в spec/factories/","Соблюдение строгого рабочего процесса SDD"],"ar":["قراءة الكود قبل الكتابة","تحليل النماذج في app/models/","التحقق من الطرق في config/routes.rb","استخدام المصانع في spec/factories/","اتباع 워크فلو стрicktly SDD"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use implement-feature","implement-feature setup guide","spec driven development workflow","gh issue view tutorial","app/models/ directory structure","spec/ folder organization","config/routes.rb configuration","implement-feature alternative","implement-feature vs traditional development"],"zh":["AI工具","Spec Driven Development","功能实现","代码库探索","相关模型","existing specs","config/routes.rb","spec/factories/"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Spec Driven Development","機能実装","コードベース探索","関連モデル","既存のspec","config/routes.rb","spec/factories/"],"ko":["AI 도구","Spec Driven Development","기능 구현","코드베이스 탐색","관련 모델","기존 spec","config/routes.rb","spec/factories/"],"es":["implementar características con SDD","Spec Driven Development","herramientas de AI","Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial","desarrollo de software","pruebas de software","gh issue view","spec/factories"],"fr":["mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités avec SDD","Spec Driven Development","outils d''IA","Outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","développement de logiciels","tests de logiciels","gh issue view","spec/factories"],"de":["Implementieren von Funktionen mit SDD","Spec Driven Development","KI-Tools","KI-Agents","Softwareentwicklung","Softwaretests","gh issue view","spec/factories"],"pt":["implementação de recurso","SDD","desenvolvimento de software","Spec Driven Development","guias de desenvolvimento","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["реализация функций","SDD","разработка программного обеспечения","Spec Driven Development","руководства по разработке","лучшие практики разработки"],"ar":["تنفيذ ميزة","SDD","تطوير البرمجيات","Spec Driven Development","دلائل التطوير","أفضل الممارسات للتطوير"]}},"owner":"common-member","repo":"NighTrip","repoPath":"common-member/NighTrip","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T00:21:24Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implement-feature","description":"Implement a feature using SDD (Spec Driven Development). Guides you through: explore → write failing specs → implement → verify.","bodyPreview":"# Implement Feature with SDD\n\n**Feature**: $ARGUMENTS\n\nFollow the Spec Driven Development workflow strictly. Do NOT skip any step.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Explore (Read Before Writing)\n\nUnderstand the codebase before writing anything:\n\n1. Read the relevant issue if a number was provided: `gh issue view $ARGUMENTS`\n2. Read related models in `app/models/`\n3. Read existing specs for similar features in `spec/`\n4. Check `config/routes.rb` for existing routes\n5. Check `spec/factories/` for available factori","body":"# Implement Feature with SDD\n\n**Feature**: $ARGUMENTS\n\nFollow the Spec Driven Development workflow strictly. Do NOT skip any step.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Explore (Read Before Writing)\n\nUnderstand the codebase before writing anything:\n\n1. Read the relevant issue if a number was provided: `gh issue view $ARGUMENTS`\n2. Read related models in `app/models/`\n3. Read existing specs for similar features in `spec/`\n4. Check `config/routes.rb` for existing routes\n5. Check `spec/factories/` for available factories\n\nSummarize what you found: what exists, what needs to be added.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Write Failing Specs First\n\n**Before writing any implementation code**, write RSpec specs:\n\n### Model specs (if adding model logic)\n- File: `spec/models/<model>_spec.rb`\n- Test validations, associations, scopes, and methods\n\n### Request specs (if adding controller actions)\n- File: `spec/requests/<resource>_spec.rb`\n- Test HTTP status, authentication, authorization\n\n### System specs (if adding user-facing features)\n- File: `spec/system/<feature>_spec.rb`\n- Test user flow with Capybara\n\nRun specs to **confirm they fail**:\n```bash\nbundle exec rspec <spec-file> --format documentation\n```\n\nShow the failing output. If specs pass without implementation, they''re testing the wrong thing.\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Implement\n\nWrite minimal code to pass the specs:\n\n1. Generate model/migration if needed: `bin/rails generate model ...`\n2. Run migrations: `bin/rails db:migrate`\n3. Add model logic (validations, associations, methods)\n4. Add controller actions with proper authentication/authorization\n5. Add views using ERB + Turbo Frames/Streams\n6. Add Stimulus controller if JavaScript behavior is needed\n\nFollow existing patterns — read similar code first.\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Verify\n\nRun specs after implementation:\n\n```bash\n# Run the new specs\nbundle exec rspec <spec-file> --format documentation\n\n# Run full test suite\nbundle exec rspec\n\n# Auto-fix linting\nbin/rubocop -a\n\n# Security scan\nbin/brakeman --no-pager\n```\n\nAll steps must pass before creating a PR.\n\n---\n\n## Step 5: Report\n\nSummarize:\n- What specs were written (file paths)\n- What was implemented (files changed)\n- Test results (pass/fail counts)\n- Any rubocop or brakeman findings\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:04:52.835Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing strict Spec Driven Development workflow adherence.","zh":"非常适合需要严格遵循规格驱动开发工作流的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが厳格なSpec Driven Developmentワークフローに従う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"严格한 규격 주도 개발 워크플로를 준수해야 하는 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan adherirse estrictamente a un flujo de desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une conformité stricte au flux de développement piloté par des spécifications.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine strikte Einhaltung des Spezifikations-getriebenen Entwicklungswerkflusses benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de uma estrutura de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Especificações rigorosa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым необходима строгая структура разработки, управляемой спецификациями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى اتباع عملية التطوير الموجهة بالمواصفات بدقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to follow a step-by-step Spec Driven Development process, guiding them through codebase exploration and new feature implementation using GitHub issues, existing specs, and config files like ''config/routes.rb'' and ''spec/factories/''.","zh":"赋予代理按照规格驱动开发过程进行步骤，指导它们通过GitHub问题、现有规格和配置文件（如''config/routes.rb''和''spec/factories/''）进行代码库探索和新功能实现。","ja":"エージェントにステップバイステップのSpec Driven Developmentプロセスを実行する能力を与え、GitHubの問題、既存の仕様、および''config/routes.rb''や''spec/factories/''などの設定ファイルを使用してコードベースの探索や新機能の実装をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 규격 주도 개발 프로세스를 단계적으로 수행할 수 있도록 하며, GitHub 문제, 기존 규격 및 ''config/routes.rb'' 및 ''spec/factories/''와 같은 구성 파일을 사용하여 코드베이스 탐색 및 새로운 기능 구현을 가이드합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a seguir un proceso de desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones paso a paso, guiándolos a través de la exploración de la base de código y la implementación de nuevas funciones utilizando problemas de GitHub, especificaciones existentes y archivos de configuración como ''config/routes.rb'' y ''spec/factories/''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre un processus de développement piloté par des spécifications étape par étape, les guidant à travers l''exploration de la base de code et la mise en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités en utilisant les problèmes GitHub, les spécifications existantes et les fichiers de configuration tels que ''config/routes.rb'' et ''spec/factories/''.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, einen schrittweisen Spezifikations-getriebenen Entwicklungsprozess zu befolgen, der sie durch die Exploration der Codebasis und die Implementierung neuer Funktionen unter Verwendung von GitHub-Problemen, bestehenden Spezifikationen und Konfigurationsdateien wie ''config/routes.rb'' und ''spec/factories/'' führt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a seguir um processo de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Especificações passo a passo, guiando-os pela exploração da base de código e implementação de novos recursos usando problemas do GitHub, especificações existentes e arquivos de configuração como ''config/routes.rb'' e ''spec/factories/''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью следовать пошаговому процессу разработки, управляемой спецификациями, руководя ими при изучении кодовой базы и реализации новых функций с помощью проблем GitHub, существующих спецификаций и файлов конфигурации, таких как ''config/routes.rb'' и ''spec/factories/''.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من اتباع عملية تطوير موجهة بالمواصفات خطوة بخطوة، وتوجيههم في استكشاف قاعدة الشفرة وتنفيذ ميزات جديدة باستخدام مشاكل GitHub والمواصفات الحالية وملفات التهيئة مثل ''config/routes.rb'' و ''spec/factories/''."},"useCases":{"en":["Exploring existing codebases for feature implementation","Generating new features based on strict Spec Driven Development workflows","Debugging feature implementations using existing specs and GitHub issues"],"zh":["探索现有代码库以实现功能","根据严格的规格驱动开发工作流生成新功能","使用现有规格和GitHub问题调试功能实现"],"ja":["既存のコードベースを探索して機能を実装する","厳格なSpec Driven Developmentワークフローに基づいて新しい機能を生成する","既存の仕様とGitHubの問題を使用して機能の実装をデバッグする"],"ko":["기존 코드베이스를 탐색하여 기능을 구현하는 것","엄격한 규격 주도 개발 워크플로우를 기반으로 새로운 기능을 생성하는 것","기존 규격 및 GitHub 문제를 사용하여 기능 구현을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Explorar bases de código existentes para implementar funciones","Generar nuevas funciones en función de flujos de desarrollo estrictamente dirigidos por especificaciones","Depurar implementaciones de funciones utilizando especificaciones existentes y problemas de GitHub"],"fr":["Explorer les bases de code existantes pour la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités","Générer de nouvelles fonctionnalités en fonction de flux de développement strictement pilotés par des spécifications","Déboguer les mises en œuvre de fonctionnalités en utilisant des spécifications existantes et des problèmes GitHub"],"de":["Exploration von bestehenden Codebasen für die Implementierung von Funktionen","Erzeugen neuer Funktionen basierend auf streng spezifikationsgetriebenen Entwicklungswerkflüssen","Fehlerbehebung bei der Implementierung von Funktionen unter Verwendung bestehender Spezifikationen und GitHub-Problemen"],"pt":["Explorar bases de código existentes para implementação de recursos","Gerar novos recursos com base em fluxos de trabalho de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Especificações rigorosos","Depurar implementações de recursos usando especificações existentes e problemas do GitHub"],"ru":["Изучение существующих кодовых баз для реализации функций","Генерация новых функций на основе строгих рабочих процессов разработки, управляемой спецификациями","Отладка реализации функций с помощью существующих спецификаций и проблем GitHub"],"ar":["استكشاف قواعد الشفرة الحالية لتنفيذ الميزات","توليد ميزات جديدة استنادا إلى سير عمل التطوير الموجهة بالمواصفات الصارمة","تصحيح أخطاء تنفيذ الميزات باستخدام المواصفات الحالية ومشاكل GitHub"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GitHub issues and repository files","Strictly follows Spec Driven Development workflow, limiting flexibility"],"zh":["需要访问GitHub问题和仓库文件","严格遵循规格驱动开发工作流，限制灵活性"],"ja":["GitHubの問題やリポジトリファイルへのアクセスが必要","Spec Driven Developmentワークフローに厳格に従うため、柔軟性が制限される"],"ko":["GitHub 문제 및 저장소 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요함","규격 주도 개발 워크플로우를 엄격히 따르므로 유연성이 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a problemas de GitHub y archivos del repositorio","Sigue estrictamente el flujo de desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones, limitando la flexibilidad"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux problèmes GitHub et aux fichiers du référentiel","Suive strictement le flux de développement piloté par des spécifications, limitant la flexibilité"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf GitHub-Probleme und Repository-Dateien","Folgt streng dem Spezifikations-getriebenen Entwicklungswerkfluss, was die Flexibilität einschränkt"],"pt":["Exige acesso a problemas do GitHub e arquivos do repositório","Segue rigorosamente o fluxo de trabalho de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Especificações, limitando a flexibilidade"],"ru":["Требует доступа к проблемам GitHub и файлам репозитория","Строго следует рабочему процессу разработки, управляемой спецификациями, ограничивая гибкость"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مشاكل GitHub وملفات المستودع","يتبع بدقة سير عمل التطوير الموجهة بالمواصفات، مما يحد من المرونة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d9f4514b683df1e423b20da3a1d9a421af86b5eb8e9a66a1e01988c72c421333","qualityScore":36}');
