INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('all-source-os/all-source/chronos-release', 'chronos-release', 'all-source-os', 'all-source', 'community', 'chronos-release all-source-os all-source community The chronos-release skill automates the release process for the AllSource Chronos monorepo, producing a single commit and immutable annotated tag. This skill benefits developers by streamlining the release process. Chronos Release是一个AIエージェント版本发布工具，支持自动化版本管理和发布 Chronos ReleaseはAIエージェントのバージョン管理とリリースを自動化するツールです Chronos Release는 AI 도구 버전 관리와发布를 자동화하는 툴입니다 Chronos Release es una habilidad que crea un commit y una etiqueta inmutable para el monorepo AllSource. Sigue una política de etiquetas inmutables para garantizar la integridad de las versiones. Chronos Release est une compétence qui crée un commit et une balise immuable pour le monorepo AllSource. Elle suit une politique de balises immuables pour garantir l''intégrité des versions. Chronos Release ist eine Fähigkeit, die einen Commit und ein unveränderliches Tag für das AllSource-Monorepo erstellt. Sie folgt einer Richtlinie für unveränderliche Tags, um die Integrität der Versionen zu gewährleisten. O Chronos Release é uma habilidade que cria lançamentos imutáveis do monorepo AllSource Chronos com commits e tags anotadas Chronos Release - это навык, создающий иммутабельные релизы монорепозитория AllSource Chronos с коммитами и аннотированными тегами ИИ Агентов الchronos release هو مهارة لإنشاء إصدارات مؤشر زمني غير قابلة للتغيير من مونوريبوزиторي AllSource Chronos معCommits و تاغات مؤشر زمني للآي آي إيجنتس how to use chronos-release chronos-release setup guide immutable tag management AllSource Chronos monorepo automated release process git tag management version bumping best practices chronos-release alternative chronos-release install AIエージェント 版本发布 版本管理 Git CLI 自动化发布 Chronos Release Produces exactly one commit and one immutable annotated tag Verifies the requested tag does not already exist using `git tag -l` Follows a strict immutable tags policy, never moving or deleting existing tags Supports version bumping for new releases, e.g., v0.10.4 instead of re-tagging v0.10.3 Automates the release process for the AllSource Chronos monorepo chronos-release is a skill that automates the release process for the AllSource Chronos monorepo, following a strict immutable tags policy.');
