ance Obsidian en cours d''exécution.","de":"Die Obsidian-CLI ist ein Befehlszeilen-Tool zur Interaktion mit einer laufenden Obsidian-Instanz.","pt":"O Obsidian CLI é uma interface de linha de comando para interagir com o Obsidian.","ru":"Obsidian CLI - это командный интерфейс для взаимодействия с Obsidian.","ar":"Obsidian CLI هو واجهة سطر الأوامر للتفاعل مع Obsidian"},"features":{"en":["Run `obsidian help` to see all available commands","Use `obsidian create` to create new notes with custom names and content","Supports parameters with values using `=` and quoted values with spaces","Includes boolean flags for silent and overwrite operations","Access full documentation at https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"zh":["支持参数和标志","提供命令参考","支持创建新笔记","支持覆盖现有笔记","支持 silent 模式"],"ja":["パラメータとフラグをサポート","コマンドリファレンスを提供","新しいノートの作成をサポート","既存のノートの上書きをサポート","サイレントモードをサポート"],"ko":["매개변수와 플래그 지원","명령 참조 제공","새 노트 생성 지원","기존 노트 덮어쓰기 지원","사일런트 모드 지원"],"es":["Interactúa con una instancia de Obsidian en ejecución","Ofrece una referencia de comandos actualizada","Permite crear notas con una sintaxis personalizada","Soporta parámetros y banderas para personalizar los comandos","Requiere Obsidian para estar abierto"],"fr":["Interagit avec une instance Obsidian en cours d''exécution","Propose une référence de commandes à jour","Permet de créer des notes avec une syntaxe personnalisée","Prend en charge des paramètres et des drapeaux pour personnaliser les commandes","Requiert Obsidian pour être ouvert"],"de":["Interagiert mit einer laufenden Obsidian-Instanz","Bietet eine Befehlsreferenz, die immer aktuell ist","Ermöglicht das Erstellen von Notizen mit einer benutzerdefinierten Syntax","Unterstützt Parameter und Flags zur Anpassung der Befehle","Benötigt Obsidian, um geöffnet zu sein"],"pt":["Comandos personalizados com parâmetros","Opção de criar notas com conteúdo personalizado","Suporte a flags booleanas","Documentação completa disponível","Comando de ajuda para ver todos os comandos disponíveis"],"ru":["Пользовательские команды с параметрами","Возможность создания заметок с пользовательским содержимым","Поддержка булевых флагов","Полная документация доступна","Команда помощи для просмотра всех доступных команд"],"ar":["أوامر مخصصة مع معاملات","خيار إنشاء ملاحظات مع محتوى مخصص","دعم لرايات بوليانية","توثيق كامل متاح","أمر المساعدة لمشاهدة جميع الأوامر المتاحة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli setup guide","obsidian-cli alternative","obsidian-cli vs other note-taking tools","obsidian-cli install","what is obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli documentation","obsidian-cli commands","obsidian-cli syntax"],"zh":["Obsidian CLI","AI工具","命令行工具","Obsidian 实例","命令参考","语法","参数","标志"],"ja":["Obsidian CLI","AIエージェント","コマンドラインツール","Obsidian インスタンス","コマンドリファレンス","構文","パラメータ","フラグ"],"ko":["Obsidian CLI","AI 도구","명령줄 도구","Obsidian 인스턴스","명령 참조","구문","매개변수","플래그"],"es":["Obsidian CLI","herramientas de línea de comandos","interacción con Obsidian","creación de notas","parámetros y banderas","referencia de comandos","Herramientas de desarrollo","Integración con Obsidian"],"fr":["CLI Obsidian","outils de ligne de commande","interaction avec Obsidian","création de notes","paramètres et drapeaux","référence de commandes","Outils de développement","Intégration avec Obsidian"],"de":["Obsidian-CLI","Befehlszeilen-Tools","Interaktion mit Obsidian","Erstellung von Notizen","Parameter und Flags","Befehlsreferenz","Entwicklungstools","Integration mit Obsidian"],"pt":["Obsidian CLI","comandos Obsidian","parâmetros Obsidian","criar notas Obsidian","flags booleanas Obsidian","documentação Obsidian CLI","ajuda Obsidian CLI","ferramentas de desenvolvimento Obsidian"],"ru":["Obsidian CLI","команды Obsidian","параметры Obsidian","создание заметок Obsidian","булевые флаги Obsidian","документация Obsidian CLI","помощь Obsidian CLI","инструменты разработки Obsidian"],"ar":["Obsidian CLI","أوامر Obsidian","معاملات Obsidian","إنشاء ملاحظات Obsidian","رايات بوليانية Obsidian","توثيق Obsidian CLI","مساعدة Obsidian CLI","أدوات تطوير Obsidian"]}},"owner":"devil666face","repo":".dotfiles","repoPath":"devil666face/.dotfiles","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T20:37:27Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"obsidian-cli","description":"Interact with Obsidian vaults using the Obsidian CLI to read, create, search, and manage notes, tasks, properties, and more. Also supports plugin and theme development with commands to reload plugins, run JavaScript, capture errors, take screenshots, and inspect the DOM. Use when the user asks to interact with their Obsidian vault, manage notes, search vault content, perform vault operations from the command line, or develop and debug Obsidian plugins and themes.","bodyPreview":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrit","body":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrite\n```\n\nFor multiline content use `\\n` for newline and `\\t` for tab.\n\n## File targeting\n\nMany commands accept `file` or `path` to target a file. Without either, the active file is used.\n\n- `file=<name>` — resolves like a wikilink (name only, no path or extension needed)\n- `path=<path>` — exact path from vault root, e.g. `folder/note.md`\n\n## Vault targeting\n\nCommands target the most recently focused vault by default. Use `vault=<name>` as the first parameter to target a specific vault:\n\n```bash\nobsidian vault=\"My Vault\" search query=\"test\"\n```\n\n## Common patterns\n\n```bash\nobsidian read file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian create name=\"New Note\" content=\"# Hello\" template=\"Template\" silent\nobsidian append file=\"My Note\" content=\"New line\"\nobsidian search query=\"search term\" limit=10\nobsidian daily:read\nobsidian daily:append content=\"- [ ] New task\"\nobsidian property:set name=\"status\" value=\"done\" file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian tasks daily todo\nobsidian tags sort=count counts\nobsidian backlinks file=\"My Note\"\n```\n\nUse `--copy` on any command to copy output to clipboard. Use `silent` to prevent files from opening. Use `total` on list commands to get a count.\n\n## Plugin development\n\n### Develop/test cycle\n\nAfter making code changes to a plugin or theme, follow this workflow:\n\n1. **Reload** the plugin to pick up changes:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian plugin:reload id=my-plugin\n   ```\n2. **Check for errors** — if errors appear, fix and repeat from step 1:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:errors\n   ```\n3. **Verify visually** with a screenshot or DOM inspection:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:screenshot path=screenshot.png\n   obsidian dev:dom selector=\".workspace-leaf\" text\n   ```\n4. **Check console output** for warnings or unexpected logs:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:console level=error\n   ```\n\n### Additional developer commands\n\nRun JavaScript in the app context:\n\n```bash\nobsidian eval code=\"app.vault.getFiles().length\"\n```\n\nInspect CSS values:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:css selector=\".workspace-leaf\" prop=background-color\n```\n\nToggle mobile emulation:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:mobile on\n```\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see additional developer commands including CDP and debugger controls.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:07:54.734Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents seeking to streamline Obsidian workflows and task automation.","zh":"适用于希望简化 Obsidian 工作流和任务自动化的自动化代理。","ja":"Obsidian のワークフローとタスクの自動化を簡素化したい自動化エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Obsidian 워크플로우 및 작업 자동화를 최적화하려는 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización que buscan simplificar flujos de trabajo y automatización de tareas de Obsidian.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation souhaitant rationaliser les flux de travail et l''automatisation des tâches d''Obsidian.","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die Obsidian-Workflows und Aufgabenautomatisierung rationalisieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que buscam otimizar os fluxos de trabalho e a automação de tarefas do Obsidian.","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, стремящихся оптимизировать рабочие процессы и автоматизацию задач Obsidian.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات وكيل الت輔م، التي تهدف إلى تحسين تدفقات العمل وتأتمة المهام في Obsidian."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with Obsidian instances using the `obsidian` command, enabling automation of tasks and workflows through parameters and flags, such as creating notes with specific names and content using `obsidian create` syntax.","zh":"赋予代理使用 `obsidian` 命令与 Obsidian 实例交互的能力，从而通过参数和标志实现任务和工作流的自动化，例如使用 `obsidian create` 语法创建具有特定名称和内容的笔记。","ja":"エージェントが `obsidian` コマンドを使用して Obsidian インスタンスとやり取りできるようにし、パラメータとフラグを使用してタスクとワークフローの自動化を可能にします。たとえば、`obsidian create` 構文を使用して特定の名前と内容を持つノートを作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 `obsidian` 명령을 사용하여 Obsidian 인스턴스와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하여 매개 변수와 플래그를 통해 작업 및 워크플로 자동화를 가능하게 합니다. 예를 들어, `obsidian create` 구문을 사용하여 특정 이름과 내용을 가진 노트를 생성합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes interactuar con instancias de Obsidian utilizando el comando `obsidian`, lo que permite la automatización de tareas y flujos de trabajo a través de parámetros y banderas, como la creación de notas con nombres y contenido específicos utilizando la sintaxis `obsidian create`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec des instances d''Obsidian en utilisant la commande `obsidian`, ce qui permet l''automatisation des tâches et des flux de travail via des paramètres et des indicateurs, tels que la création de notes avec des noms et un contenu spécifiques en utilisant la syntaxe `obsidian create`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, mit Obsidian-Instanzen über den `obsidian`-Befehl zu interagieren, wodurch die Automatisierung von Aufgaben und Workflows über Parameter und Flags ermöglicht wird, wie z. B. die Erstellung von Notizen mit bestimmten Namen und Inhalten unter Verwendung der `obsidian create`-Syntax.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir com instâncias do Obsidian usando o comando `obsidian`, permitindo a automação de tarefas e fluxos de trabalho por meio de parâmetros e flags, como criar notas com nomes e conteúdo específicos usando a sintaxe `obsidian create`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам взаимодействовать с экземплярами Obsidian с помощью команды `obsidian`, что позволяет автоматизировать задачи и рабочие процессы с помощью параметров и флагов, таких как создание заметок с конкретными именами и содержимым с помощью синтаксиса `obsidian create`.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من التفاعل مع مثيلات Obsidian باستخدام الأمر `obsidian`، مما يتيح автоматизacıة المهام والتدفقات العمل من خلال المعاملات والرموز، مثل إنشاء الملاحظات بأسماء ومحتوى محدد باستخدام بناء الجملة `obsidian create`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating note creation with custom names and content","Generating templated notes using the `obsidian` CLI","Streamlining workflows by scripting Obsidian interactions"],"zh":["使用自定义名称和内容自动创建笔记","使用 `obsidian` CLI 生成模板化笔记","通过脚本 Obsidian 交互来简化工作流"],"ja":["カスタム名と内容でノートを作成する自動化","`obsidian` CLI を使用してテンプレート化されたノートを生成する","Obsidian のやり取りをスクリプト化してワークフローを最適化する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 이름 및 내용으로 노트를 자동으로 생성하는 것","`obsidian` CLI를 사용하여 템플릿화된 노트를 생성하는 것","Obsidian 상호 작용을 스크립팅하여 워크플ロー 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de notas con nombres y contenido personalizados","Generación de notas con plantillas utilizando la CLI de `obsidian`","Optimización de flujos de trabajo mediante la programación de interacciones con Obsidian"],"fr":["Automation de la création de notes avec des noms et un contenu personnalisés","Génération de notes avec des modèles à l''aide de la CLI `obsidian`","Optimisation des flux de travail en programmant les interactions avec Obsidian"],"de":["Automatisierung der Notizenerstellung mit benutzerdefinierten Namen und Inhalten","Generierung von Notizen mit Vorlagen unter Verwendung der `obsidian`-CLI","Optimierung von Workflows durch Skripten von Interaktionen mit Obsidian"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de notas com nomes e conteúdo personalizados","Gerar notas modeladas usando o `obsidian` CLI","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho ao registrar interações do Obsidian"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание заметок с пользовательскими именами и содержимым","Генерировать шаблонные заметки с помощью `obsidian` CLI","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы, записывая взаимодействия с Obsidian"],"ar":["تأتمة إنشاء الملاحظات بأسماء ومحتوى مخصصين","توليد الملاحظات المقوّاة باستخدام `obsidian` CLI","تحسين التدفقات العمل عن طريق تسجيل التفاعلات مع Obsidian"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Obsidian to be open and running","Limited to features and commands exposed by the Obsidian CLI"],"zh":["需要 Obsidian 打开并运行","仅限于 Obsidian CLI 暴露的功能和命令"],"ja":["Obsidian が開かれ、実行されている必要がある","Obsidian CLI で公開されている機能とコマンドに限定される"],"ko":["Obsidian이 열리고 실행되고 있어야 함","Obsidian CLI에서 노출되는 기능 및 명령어로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere que Obsidian esté abierto y en ejecución","Limitado a las características y comandos expuestos por la CLI de Obsidian"],"fr":["Nécessite qu''Obsidian soit ouvert et en cours d''exécution","Limité aux fonctionnalités et commandes exposées par la CLI d''Obsidian"],"de":["Benötigt, dass Obsidian geöffnet und ausgeführt wird","Begrenzt auf die von der Obsidian-CLI bereitgestellten Funktionen und Befehle"],"pt":["Exige que o Obsidian esteja aberto e em execução","Limitado às funcionalidades e comandos expostos pelo `obsidian` CLI"],"ru":["Требует того, чтобы Obsidian был открыт и запущен","Ограничен функциями и командами, экспонированными `obsidian` CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب أن يكون Obsidian مفتوحًا ويعمل","محدود بالوظائف والأوامر المعروضة بواسطة `obsidian` CLI"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b54257cdc0e5d04488b35b0c797bfe427b24359f0848d3c73924dcacf8da6358","qualityScore":36}');
