avec git status --porcelain","Prise en charge de la CLI d''OpenClaw","Compatibilité avec Twitter API"],"de":["Führt den vollständigen Release-Workflow für @1a35e1/sonar-cli aus","Validierung von Argumenten für semver bump type: patch, minor oder major","Überprüfung des sauberen Arbeitsverzeichnisses mit git status --porcelain","Unterstützung für die OpenClaw-CLI","Kompatibilität mit Twitter API"],"pt":["Fluxo de trabalho de lançamento experimental com OpenClaw","Executa o pipeline de lançamento completo para @1a35e1/sonar-cli","Suporte a semver para controle de versão","Validação de argumentos para garantir a entrada correta","Cheques de pré-voo para garantir a integridade do código"],"ru":["Экспериментальный flux работы выпуска с помощью OpenClaw и ИИ Агентов","Выполняет полный pipeline выпуска для @1a35e1/sonar-cli","Поддержка semver для контроля версий","Валидация аргументов для обеспечения правильного ввода","Предполетные проверки для обеспечения целостности кода"],"ar":["تدفق عمل إصدار تجريبي مع OpenClaw وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","يقوم بتنفيذ خط أنابيب الإصدار الكامل لـ @1a35e1/sonar-cli","دعم semver لمراقبة الإصدار","تحقق من المدخلات لضمان إدخال صحيح","فحص ما قبل الطيران لضمان سلامة الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use release skill","release skill setup guide","openclaw release workflow","twitter api release pipeline","release skill vs github actions","release skill install","what is release skill","release skill alternative","release skill for ai agents"],"zh":["Release 工作流","Experimental X CLI","OpenClaw","语义版本升级","自动化流程","Git 工作树清理","预检检查"],"ja":["リリース ワークフロー","Experimental X CLI","OpenClaw","セマンティック バージョニング","自動化プロセス","Git 作業ツリーのクリーンアップ","プレフライト チェック"],"ko":["릴리즈 워크플로우","Experimental X CLI","OpenClaw","시맨틱 버저닝","자동화 프로세스","Git 작업 트리 정리","사전 체크"],"es":["release OpenClaw","CLI de OpenClaw","flujo de trabajo de lanzamiento","automatización de lanzamiento","semver bump type","git status --porcelain","Twitter API","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["release OpenClaw","CLI d''OpenClaw","flux de travail de lancement","automatisation de lancement","semver bump type","git status --porcelain","Twitter API","outils de développement"],"de":["Release OpenClaw","OpenClaw-CLI","Release-Workflow","Automatisierung von Releases","semver bump type","git status --porcelain","Twitter API","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["release workflow","openclaw","semver","cli experimental","fluxo de trabalho de lançamento","controle de versão","validação de argumentos","cheques de pré-voo"],"ru":["релиз workflow","openclaw","semver","экспериментальный cli","flux работы выпуска","контроль версий","валидация аргументов","предполетные проверки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["إصدار تدفق عمل","openclaw","semver","واجهة سطر الأوامر التجريبية","تدفق عمل إصدار","مراقبة الإصدار","تحقق من المدخلات","فحص ما قبل الطيران","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"1a35e1","repo":"sonar-cli","repoPath":"1a35e1/sonar-cli","stars":2,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T22:01:45Z","topics":["openclaw","skill","twitter-api"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release","description":"Run the full npm release workflow — version bump, changelog, build, publish, push, and GitHub release.","bodyPreview":"# Release Workflow\n\nExecute the full release pipeline for `@1a35e1/sonar-cli`. The user invokes this skill with a semver bump type: `patch`, `minor`, or `major`.\n\n## Argument Validation\n\nThe argument MUST be one of: `patch`, `minor`, or `major`. If missing or invalid, print usage and stop:\n\n```\nUsage: /release <patch|minor|major>\n```\n\n## Step 1: Pre-flight Checks\n\nRun these checks sequentially. Abort on the first failure with a clear message.\n\n1. **Clean working tree**: Run `git status --porcela","body":"# Release Workflow\n\nExecute the full release pipeline for `@1a35e1/sonar-cli`. The user invokes this skill with a semver bump type: `patch`, `minor`, or `major`.\n\n## Argument Validation\n\nThe argument MUST be one of: `patch`, `minor`, or `major`. If missing or invalid, print usage and stop:\n\n```\nUsage: /release <patch|minor|major>\n```\n\n## Step 1: Pre-flight Checks\n\nRun these checks sequentially. Abort on the first failure with a clear message.\n\n1. **Clean working tree**: Run `git status --porcelain`. If output is non-empty, abort: \"Working tree is not clean. Commit or stash changes first.\"\n2. **On main branch**: Run `git branch --show-current`. If not `main`, abort: \"Must be on the main branch to release.\"\n3. **Typecheck passes**: Run `pnpm build` (this runs `tsc`). If it fails, abort: \"Build failed. Fix type errors before releasing.\"\n\n## Step 2: Version Bump\n\n1. Run `pnpm version <BUMP_TYPE> --no-git-tag-version` to bump the version in `package.json`.\n2. Read `package.json` and extract the new `\"version\"` field. Store it as `NEW_VERSION` for use in later steps.\n3. Print: \"Version bumped to NEW_VERSION\"\n\n## Step 3: Update CHANGELOG\n\n1. Collect commits since the last release. Run:\n   ```\n   git log --oneline $(git log --all --grep=''chore: release'' --format=''%H'' -1)..HEAD\n   ```\n   If no release commit is found, collect all commits with `git log --oneline`.\n\n2. Generate a new changelog section following the existing Keep a Changelog format. Use today''s date (YYYY-MM-DD). Categorize commits under `### Added`, `### Fixed`, `### Changed`, etc. based on conventional commit prefixes (`feat:` -> Added, `fix:` -> Fixed, `chore:`/`refactor:` -> Changed). Omit empty categories. Each entry should be a bullet starting with the commit message in bold, with a short description if the message is clear enough.\n\n3. Insert the new section into `CHANGELOG.md` immediately after the header block (the `# Changelog` line and the two description lines). The new section goes BEFORE any existing `## [x.y.z]` sections.\n\n   Example format:\n   ```markdown\n   ## [0.3.0] - 2026-03-04\n\n   ### Added\n\n   - **feat: add foo command** — Description of the change.\n\n   ### Fixed\n\n   - **fix: bar edge case** — Description of the fix.\n   ```\n\n4. Print the generated changelog section for the user to review.\n\n## Step 4: Build\n\nRun `pnpm build` to compile TypeScript to `dist/`. Abort if this fails.\n\n## Step 5: Git Commit\n\n1. Stage exactly these files: `package.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, `CHANGELOG.md`\n2. Commit with message: `chore: release NEW_VERSION`\n3. Print: \"Committed: chore: release NEW_VERSION\"\n\n## Step 6: npm Publish (Confirmation Gate)\n\n**ASK THE USER FOR CONFIRMATION AND COLLECT OTP** before proceeding:\n\n> Ready to publish `@1a35e1/sonar-cli@NEW_VERSION` to npm. Provide your npm OTP to proceed (or \"skip\" to stop).\n\nIf the user provides an OTP:\n1. Run `pnpm publish --access public --otp <OTP>`\n2. Confirm success. If it fails, abort with the error output.\n\nIf the user says \"skip\" or denies, stop the workflow here.\n\n## Step 7: Push + GitHub Release (Confirmation Gate)\n\n**ASK THE USER FOR CONFIRMATION** before proceeding:\n\n> Ready to push to remote and create GitHub release v{NEW_VERSION}. Proceed?\n\nIf confirmed:\n1. Run `git push`\n2. Create a GitHub release using the changelog section from Step 3:\n   ```\n   gh release create v<NEW_VERSION> --title \"v<NEW_VERSION>\" --notes \"<changelog section from step 3>\"\n   ```\n3. Print the GitHub release URL from the `gh` output.\n\nIf denied, remind the user they can push and create the release manually later.\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If any command fails, print the full error output and abort immediately.\n- Do NOT continue past a failed step — each step depends on the previous one.\n- If publish fails, the commit is already made locally. Inform the user they can retry with `pnpm publish --access public` after fixing the issue.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T12:50:08.588Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CI/CD Agents requiring automated semver release management for projects like @1a35e1/sonar-cli","zh":"适合需要自动化semver版本管理的CI/CD Agents，例如@1a35e1/sonar-cli项目","ja":"CI/CDエージェントが自動化されたsemverリリース管理を必要とする場合に適しています。例として、@1a35e1/sonar-cliのようなプロジェクト","ko":"자동화된 semver 버전 관리가 필요한 CI/CD 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어, @1a35e1/sonar-cli 같은 프로젝트","es":"Ideal para agentes de CI/CD que requieren una gestión de versiones semver automatizada para proyectos como @1a35e1/sonar-cli","fr":"Idéal pour les agents CI/CD nécessitant une gestion de version semver automatisée pour des projets comme @1a35e1/sonar-cli","de":"Ideal für CI/CD-Agents, die eine automatisierte semver-Veröffentlichungsverwaltung für Projekte wie @1a35e1/sonar-cli erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de CI/CD que exigem gerenciamento de versão semver automatizado para projetos como @1a35e1/sonar-cli","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов CI/CD, требующих автоматизированного управления версиями semver для проектов типа @1a35e1/sonar-cli","ar":"مثالية لعمليات CI/CD التي تتطلب إدارة الإصدارات semver التلقائية لمشاريع مثل @1a35e1/sonar-cli"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute full release pipelines with semver bump types, streamlining development workflows for OpenClaw and Twitter API projects using Git and semantic versioning","zh":"赋予代理执行完整的发布流水线的能力，具有semver bump类型，简化OpenClaw和Twitter API项目的开发工作流程，使用Git和语义版本控制","ja":"エージェントがsemverバンプタイプを使用してフルリリースパイプラインを実行する能力を与え、OpenClawとTwitter APIプロジェクトの開発ワークフローを簡素化する。Gitとセマンティックバージョニングを使用","ko":"에이전트가 semver bump 유형을 사용하여 전체 릴리스 파이프라인을 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 OpenClaw와 Twitter API 프로젝트의 개발 워크플ロー를 간소화합니다. Git 및 의미 버전 관리를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar canalizaciones de lanzamiento completas con tipos de incremento semver, simplificando los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo para proyectos de OpenClaw y Twitter API que utilizan Git y versiones semánticas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des pipelines de publication complets avec des types d''incrémentation semver, rationalisant les flux de travail de développement pour les projets OpenClaw et Twitter API utilisant Git et la version sémantique","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vollständige Release-Pipelines mit semver-Inkrementtypen auszuführen, wodurch die Entwicklungsworkflows für OpenClaw- und Twitter-API-Projekte, die Git und semantische Versionierung verwenden, rationalisiert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar pipelines de lançamento completos com tipos de aumento de semver, otimizando fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento para projetos OpenClaw e Twitter API que usam Git e versionamento semântico","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять полные конвейеры выпуска с типами инкремента semver, оптимизируя рабочие процессы разработки для проектов OpenClaw и Twitter API, использующих Git и семантическое версионирование","ar":"تمكين العوامل من تشغيل خطوط أنابيب الإصدار الكاملة مع أنواع بамп semver ، وتسهيل سير عمل التطوير لمشاريع OpenClaw و Twitter API التي تستخدم Git و الإصدارات الدلالية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating patch releases for bug fixes","Generating minor releases for new features","Triggering major releases for significant updates"],"zh":["自动化补丁发布以修复错误","生成次要发布以添加新功能","触发主要发布以进行重大更新"],"ja":["バグ修正のためのパッチリリースの自動化","新しい機能のためのマイナーリリースの生成","重大な更新のためのメジャーリリースのトリガー"],"ko":["버그 수정을 위한 패치 릴리스 자동화","새로운 기능을 위한 마이너 릴리스 생성","重大한 업데이트를 위한 메이저 릴리스 트리거"],"es":["Automatizar lanzamientos de revisión para correcciones de errores","Generar lanzamientos menores para nuevas características","Disparar lanzamientos principales para actualizaciones significativas"],"fr":["Automatiser les versions de correctifs pour les corrections de bogues","Générer des versions mineures pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités","Déclencher des versions majeures pour des mises à jour significatives"],"de":["Automatisieren von Patch-Veröffentlichungen für Fehlerkorrekturen","Generieren von Minor-Veröffentlichungen für neue Funktionen","Auslösen von Major-Veröffentlichungen für wesentliche Updates"],"pt":["Automatizar lançamentos de patch para correções de bugs","Gerar lançamentos menores para novos recursos","Disparar lançamentos principais para atualizações significativas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выпуски патчей для исправления ошибок","Генерировать минорные выпуски для новых функций","Запускать мейджорные выпуски для значительных обновлений"],"ar":["التحكم التلقائي في إصدارات التصحيح لتصحيح الأخطاء","توليد إصدارات صغيرة لسمات جديدة","تشغيل إصدارات رئيسية للتحديثات المهمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Limited to semver bump types: patch, minor, or major"],"zh":["需要Git仓库访问权限","仅限semver bump类型：补丁、次要或主要"],"ja":["Gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","semverバンプタイプが限定されています：パッチ、ミノル、メジャー"],"ko":["Git 저장소 액세스가 필요함","semver bump 유형이 제한됨: 패치, 마이너, 메이저"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio Git","Limitado a tipos de incremento semver: revisión, menor o principal"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Limité aux types d''incrémentation semver : correctif, mineur ou majeur"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Begrenzt auf semver-Inkrementtypen: Patch, Minor oder Major"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório Git","Limitado a tipos de aumento de semver: patch, minor ou major"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Git","Ограничен типами инкремента semver: patch, minor или major"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Git","محدود بنوع بамп semver: تصحيح ، صغير أو رئيسي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"bf59bf951195f61376852259dedc4a829171b3eee04e8043de642815b3a8705d","qualityScore":36}');
