llation d''obsidian-cli pour les développeurs","de":"Einrichtungsanleitung für obsidian-cli-Entwickler","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Obsidian-CLI para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Настройка Obsidian-CLI: Руководство для Разработчиков ИИ ...","ar":"دليل تشغيل Obsidian-CLI للاستفادة من أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to interact with Obsidian instances using the obsidian-cli. Learn to run commands, create notes, and more. Get started with our setup guide today!","zh":"了解 Obsidian CLI 的技术细节，并掌握如何将其与 Claude Code 无缝集成，提升开发效率","ja":"Obsidian CLI の技術的な詳細を学び、Claude Code との統合方法をマスターして開発の効率を上げる","ko":"Obsidian CLI의 기술적 세부 사항을 알아보고 Claude Code와의 통합 방법을 마스터하여 개발 효율성을 높여보세요","es":"Aprende a utilizar el comando obsidian-cli para interactuar con instancias de Obsidian en ejecución y mejora tu flujo de trabajo","fr":"Découvrez comment utiliser la commande obsidian-cli pour interagir avec des instances Obsidian en cours d''exécution et améliorez votre flux de travail","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie den Befehl obsidian-cli verwenden, um mit ausführbaren Obsidian-Instanzen zu interagieren und Ihren Arbeitsablauf zu optimieren","pt":"Aprenda a usar o Obsidian-CLI para interagir com instâncias do Obsidian em execução e descubra como criar notas e mais","ru":"Узнайте, как использовать Obsidian-CLI для взаимодействия с запущенными экземплярами Obsidian и создания заметок","ar":"تعرف على كيفية استخدام Obsidian-CLI للتفاعل مع مثيلات Obsidian العاملة وإنشاء الملاحظات بسهولة"},"definition":{"en":"obsidian-cli is a command-line interface for interacting with Obsidian instances, providing features like note creation and command reference.","zh":"Obsidian CLI 是一个命令行接口，用于与运行中的 Obsidian 实例交互","ja":"Obsidian CLI は、実行中の Obsidian インスタンスと対話するためのコマンドラインインターフェースです","ko":"Obsidian CLI는 실행 중인 Obsidian 인스턴스와 상호 작용하기 위한 명령줄 인터페이스입니다","es":"obsidian-cli es una herramienta de línea de comandos para interactuar con instancias de Obsidian","fr":"obsidian-cli est un outil de ligne de commande pour interagir avec des instances Obsidian","de":"obsidian-cli ist ein Befehlszeilen-Tool zur Interaktion mit ausführbaren Obsidian-Instanzen","pt":"O que é Obsidian-CLI? É uma ferramenta de linha de comando para interagir com o Obsidian.","ru":"Что такое Obsidian-CLI? Это инструмент командной строки для взаимодействия с Obsidian.","ar":"ما هو Obsidian-CLI؟ إنه أداة سطر أوامر للتفاعل مع Obsidian."},"features":{"en":["Run `obsidian help` to see all available commands","Create notes using the `obsidian create` command with parameters like `name` and `content`","Use flags like `silent` and `overwrite` to customize command behavior","Quote values with spaces using the `=` operator","Access full documentation at https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"zh":["使用 `obsidian` CLI 与运行中的 Obsidian 实例交互","支持参数和标志，例如 `create` 和 `silent`","可以创建新笔记，例如 `obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"`","支持帮助命令，例如 `obsidian help`","提供完整的文档，例如 https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"ja":["実行中の Obsidian インスタンスと対話するための `obsidian` CLI を使用","パラメータとフラグのサポート、例えば `create` と `silent`","新しいノートを作成することができます、例えば `obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"`","ヘルプコマンドのサポート、例えば `obsidian help`","完全なドキュメントの提供、例えば https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"ko":["실행 중인 Obsidian 인스턴스와 상호 작용하기 위한 `obsidian` CLI 사용","파라미터와 플래그 지원, 예를 들어 `create`와 `silent`","새로운 노트를 생성할 수 있습니다, 예를 들어 `obsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"`","도움말 명령어 지원, 예를 들어 `obsidian help`","完整한 문서 제공, 예를 들어 https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"es":["Ejecuta comandos con parámetros y opciones","Crea notas con contenido personalizado","Soporte para valores con espacios mediante comillas","Compatibilidad con banderas booleanas silenciosas y de sobrescritura"],"fr":["Exécute des commandes avec des paramètres et des options","Créez des notes avec un contenu personnalisé","Prise en charge des valeurs avec des espaces via des guillemets","Compatibilité avec des drapeaux booléens silencieux et de remplacement"],"de":["Führt Befehle mit Parametern und Optionen aus","Erstellt Notizen mit benutzerdefiniertem Inhalt","Unterstützung für Werte mit Leerzeichen durch Anführungszeichen","Kompatibilität mit booleschen Flags für Stille und Überschreibung"],"pt":["Crie notas com o comando `obsidian create`","Use parâmetros com `=` para especificar valores","Use flags booleanos para controlar o comportamento","Interaja com instâncias do Obsidian em execução","Acesse a documentação completa em https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"ru":["Создайте заметки с помощью команды `obsidian create`","Используйте параметры с `=` для указания значений","Используйте булевы флаги для контроля поведения","Взаимодействуйте с запущенными экземплярами Obsidian","Доступ к полной документации на https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"ar":["أنشئ ملاحظات باستخدام الأمر `obsidian create`","استخدم المعلمات ب `=` لتحديد القيم","استخدم أعلام 논ية للتحكم في السلوك","تفاعل مع مثيلات Obsidian العاملة","الوصول إلى الوثائق الكاملة على https://help.obsidian.md/cli"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli setup guide","obsidian-cli alternative","obsidian-cli vs claude code","obsidian-cli install","what is obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli command reference","obsidian-cli note creation"],"zh":["Obsidian CLI","AI 工具","Claude Code","命令行接口","Obsidian Vault","工程师工具","开发效率","AI 集成"],"ja":["Obsidian CLI","AI エージェント","Claude Code","コマンドラインインターフェース","Obsidian Vault","エンジニア向けツール","開発効率","AI 統合"],"ko":["Obsidian CLI","AI 도구","Claude Code","명령줄 인터페이스","Obsidian Vault","엔지니어를 위한 도구","개발 효율성","AI 통합"],"es":["obsidian-cli","herramientas de línea de comandos","desarrollo de software","inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores","Herramientas de productividad para desarrolladores","Guías de configuración de obsidian-cli","Mejora del flujo de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["obsidian-cli","outils de ligne de commande","développement de logiciels","intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs","Outils de productivité pour les développeurs","Guides d''installation d''obsidian-cli","Amélioration du flux de travail de développement"],"de":["obsidian-cli","Befehlszeilentools","Software-Entwicklung","Künstliche Intelligenz für Entwickler","Produktivitätstools für Entwickler","Einrichtungsanleitungen für obsidian-cli","Optimierung des Entwicklungsworkflows"],"pt":["Obsidian-CLI","ferramenta de linha de comando","interagir com Obsidian","criar notas","parâmetros","flags booleanos","documentação Obsidian"],"ru":["Obsidian-CLI","инструмент командной строки","взаимодействие с Obsidian","создание заметок","параметры","булевы флаги","документация Obsidian"],"ar":["Obsidian-CLI","أداة سطر أوامر","التفاعل مع Obsidian","إنشاء الملاحظات","المعلمات","أعلام 논ية","وثائق Obsidian"]}},"owner":"breferrari","repo":"obsidian-mind","repoPath":"breferrari/obsidian-mind","stars":1,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T01:02:33Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"obsidian-cli","description":"Interact with Obsidian vaults using the Obsidian CLI to read, create, search, and manage notes, tasks, properties, and more. Also supports plugin and theme development with commands to reload plugins, run JavaScript, capture errors, take screenshots, and inspect the DOM. Use when the user asks to interact with their Obsidian vault, manage notes, search vault content, perform vault operations from the command line, or develop and debug Obsidian plugins and themes.","bodyPreview":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrit","body":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrite\n```\n\nFor multiline content use `\\n` for newline and `\\t` for tab.\n\n## File targeting\n\nMany commands accept `file` or `path` to target a file. Without either, the active file is used.\n\n- `file=<name>` — resolves like a wikilink (name only, no path or extension needed)\n- `path=<path>` — exact path from vault root, e.g. `folder/note.md`\n\n## Vault targeting\n\nCommands target the most recently focused vault by default. Use `vault=<name>` as the first parameter to target a specific vault:\n\n```bash\nobsidian vault=\"My Vault\" search query=\"test\"\n```\n\n## Common patterns\n\n```bash\nobsidian read file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian create name=\"New Note\" content=\"# Hello\" template=\"Template\" silent\nobsidian append file=\"My Note\" content=\"New line\"\nobsidian search query=\"search term\" limit=10\nobsidian daily:read\nobsidian daily:append content=\"- [ ] New task\"\nobsidian property:set name=\"status\" value=\"done\" file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian tasks daily todo\nobsidian tags sort=count counts\nobsidian backlinks file=\"My Note\"\n```\n\nUse `--copy` on any command to copy output to clipboard. Use `silent` to prevent files from opening. Use `total` on list commands to get a count.\n\n## Plugin development\n\n### Develop/test cycle\n\nAfter making code changes to a plugin or theme, follow this workflow:\n\n1. **Reload** the plugin to pick up changes:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian plugin:reload id=my-plugin\n   ```\n2. **Check for errors** — if errors appear, fix and repeat from step 1:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:errors\n   ```\n3. **Verify visually** with a screenshot or DOM inspection:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:screenshot path=screenshot.png\n   obsidian dev:dom selector=\".workspace-leaf\" text\n   ```\n4. **Check console output** for warnings or unexpected logs:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:console level=error\n   ```\n\n### Additional developer commands\n\nRun JavaScript in the app context:\n\n```bash\nobsidian eval code=\"app.vault.getFiles().length\"\n```\n\nInspect CSS values:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:css selector=\".workspace-leaf\" prop=background-color\n```\n\nToggle mobile emulation:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:mobile on\n```\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see additional developer commands including CDP and debugger controls.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:54:29.060Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Management Agents needing seamless integration with Obsidian instances via command line interfaces.","zh":"非常适合需要与 Obsidian 实例通过命令行接口实现无缝集成的知识管理代理。","ja":"Obsidian インスタンスとのシームレスな統合が必要なナレッジマネージメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Obsidian 인스턴스와 명령줄 인터페이스를 통해 무결점 통합이 필요한 지식 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Conocimiento que necesitan una integración perfecta con instancias de Obsidian a través de interfaces de línea de comandos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion des connaissances nécessitant une intégration transparente avec des instances Obsidian via des interfaces de ligne de commande.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Obsidian-Instanzen über Kommandozeilen-Interfaces benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que necessitam de integração perfeita com instâncias do Obsidian via interfaces de linha de comando.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления знаниями, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция с экземплярами Obsidian через командную строку.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة المعرفة الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متكامل مع مثيلات Obsidian عبر واجهات سطر الأوامر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with Obsidian using the `obsidian` CLI, enabling note creation, help viewing, and more, with support for parameters and flags, such as `name=` and `silent`.","zh":"赋予代理使用 `obsidian` CLI 与 Obsidian 交互的能力，实现创建笔记、查看帮助等功能，并支持参数和标志，例如 `name=` 和 `silent`。","ja":"`obsidian` CLI を使用して Obsidian とやり取りするエージェントを可能にし、ノートの作成、ヘルプの表示などをパラメータとフラグ（例： `name=` および `silent`）でサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 `obsidian` CLI를 사용하여 Obsidian과 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하여, 노트 생성, 도움말 보기 등을 지원하며, 매개 변수 및 플래그(예: `name=` 및 `silent`)를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con Obsidian utilizando el `obsidian` CLI, lo que permite la creación de notas, la visualización de ayuda y más, con soporte para parámetros y opciones, como `name=` y `silent`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec Obsidian en utilisant le `obsidian` CLI, permettant la création de notes, l''affichage de l''aide et plus encore, avec un support pour les paramètres et les options, tels que `name=` et `silent`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mit Obsidian über das `obsidian` CLI zu interagieren, wodurch die Erstellung von Notizen, die Anzeige von Hilfe und mehr ermöglicht wird, mit Unterstützung für Parameter und Flags, wie `name=` und `silent`.","pt":"Permite que os agentes interajam com o Obsidian usando o `obsidian` CLI, habilitando a criação de notas, visualização de ajuda e muito mais, com suporte a parâmetros e flags, como `name=` e `silent`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам взаимодействовать с Obsidian с помощью `obsidian` CLI, обеспечивая создание заметок, просмотр справки и многое другое, с поддержкой параметров и флагов, таких как `name=` и `silent`.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من التفاعل مع Obsidian باستخدام `obsidian` CLI، مما يتيح إنشاء الملاحظات وتصفح المستندات واكثر من ذلك، مع دعم للمعاملات والflags مثل `name=` و `silent`."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating notes programmatically","Automating help documentation viewing","Debugging Obsidian instances using command line tools"],"zh":["以编程方式创建笔记","自动化帮助文档的查看","使用命令行工具调试 Obsidian 实例"],"ja":["プログラム的にノートを作成する","ヘルプドキュメントの表示を自動化する","コマンドラインツールを使用して Obsidian インスタンスをデバッグする"],"ko":["프로그래밍 방식으로 노트 생성","도움말 문서 보기 자동화","명령줄 도구를 사용하여 Obsidian 인스턴스 디버깅"],"es":["Crear notas de forma programática","Automatizar la visualización de la documentación de ayuda","Depurar instancias de Obsidian utilizando herramientas de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Créer des notes de manière programmatique","Automatiser l''affichage de la documentation d''aide","Déboguer des instances Obsidian en utilisant des outils de ligne de commande"],"de":["Notizen programmatisch erstellen","Hilfedokumentation automatisch anzeigen","Obsidian-Instanzen mit Kommandozeilen-Tools debuggen"],"pt":["Criação de notas de forma programática","Automatização da visualização da documentação de ajuda","Depuração de instâncias do Obsidian usando ferramentas de linha de comando"],"ru":["Программное создание заметок","Автоматизация просмотра справочной документации","Отладка экземпляров Obsidian с помощью инструментов командной строки"],"ar":["إنشاء الملاحظات البرمجية","تأتمة عرض مستندات المساعدة","تصحيح أخطاء مثيلات Obsidian باستخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Obsidian to be open","Limited to command line interactions"],"zh":["需要 Obsidian 打开","仅限命令行交互"],"ja":["Obsidian が開かれている必要がある","コマンドラインのやり取りのみ"],"ko":["Obsidian이 열려 있는必要가 있음","명령줄 상호 작용만"],"es":["Requiere que Obsidian esté abierto","Limitado a interacciones de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite que Obsidian soit ouvert","Limité aux interactions de ligne de commande"],"de":["Erfordert, dass Obsidian geöffnet ist","Begrenzt auf Kommandozeilen-Interaktionen"],"pt":["Requer que o Obsidian esteja aberto","Limitado a interações de linha de comando"],"ru":["Требует открытия Obsidian","Ограничен взаимодействиями с командной строкой"],"ar":["يتطلب أن يكون Obsidian مفتوحا","محدود بالتفاعلات مع سطر الأوامر"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b54257cdc0e5d04488b35