r runtimes including Docker, containerd, and CRI-O","Provides easy addon management for customized cluster setup","Can be installed on macOS using Homebrew or direct download","Can be installed on Linux using curl and manual installation","Runs a single-node Kubernetes cluster locally for development and testing","Supports various Kubernetes features for local development"],"zh":["支持 Docker、containerd 和 CRI-O 容器运行时","易于管理的插件","本地运行单节点 Kubernetes 集群","支持 macOS 和 Linux 系统","使用 Homebrew 或直接下载安装"],"ja":["Docker、containerd、CRI-O コンテナランタイムをサポート","簡単なアドオン管理","ローカルでシングルノード Kubernetes クラスターを実行","macOS と Linux システムをサポート","Homebrew または直接ダウンロードでインストール"],"ko":["Docker, containerd, CRI-O 컨테이너 런타임 지원","쉬운 애드온 관리","로컬에서 단일 노드 Kubernetes 클러스터 실행","macOS 및 Linux 시스템 지원","Homebrew 또는 직접 다운로드로 설치"],"es":["Soporte para múltiples tiempos de ejecución de contenedores (Docker, containerd, CRI-O)","Administración sencilla de complementos","Instalación en macOS y Linux","Compatibilidad con clústeres de Kubernetes de un solo nodo","Desarrollo y pruebas locales"],"fr":["Prise en charge de plusieurs temps d''exécution de conteneurs (Docker, containerd, CRI-O)","Gestion facile des compléments","Installation sur macOS et Linux","Compatibilité avec des clusters Kubernetes à un seul nœud","Développement et tests locaux"],"de":["Unterstützung für mehrere Container-Laufzeiten (Docker, containerd, CRI-O)","Einfache Verwaltung von Erweiterungen","Installation auf macOS und Linux","Kompatibilität mit Kubernetes-Clustern mit einem einzigen Knoten","Lokale Entwicklung und Tests"],"pt":["Suporte a múltiplos runtimes de contêiner (Docker, containerd, CRI-O)","Gerenciamento fácil de addons","Instalação via Homebrew ou download direto","Suporte a desenvolvimento e teste de aplicações Kubernetes","Execução de clusters Kubernetes locais"],"ru":["Поддержка нескольких контейнерных runtime (Docker, containerd, CRI-O)","Легкое управление аддонами","Установка через Homebrew или прямую загрузку","Поддержка разработки и тестирования приложений Kubernetes","Запуск локальных кластеров Kubernetes"],"ar":["دعم لعدة زمن تشغيل حاويات (دوكير، كونتينرد، سي آر آي أو)","إدارة أسهلة لإضافات البرنامج","تثبيت عبر هومبريو أو تحميل مباشر","دعم لاستخدامات التطوير والاختبار لتطبيقات كيوبيرنتس","تشغيل مجموعات كيوبيرنتس المحلية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use minikube","minikube installation guide","minikube vs k3s","minikube setup for developers","what is minikube","minikube alternative","minikube local Kubernetes cluster","minikube install on macOS","minikube install on Linux"],"zh":["Minikube","Kubernetes","本地开发环境","容器运行时","Docker","containerd","CRI-O","macOS","Linux","Homebrew"],"ja":["Minikube","Kubernetes","ローカル開発環境","コンテナランタイム","Docker","containerd","CRI-O","macOS","Linux","Homebrew","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Minikube","Kubernetes","로컬 개발 환경","컨테이너 런타임","Docker","containerd","CRI-O","macOS","Linux","Homebrew","AI 도구"],"es":["minikube","kubernetes","desarrollo local","pruebas locales","contenedores","docker","containerd","CRI-O","clúster de kubernetes","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["minikube","kubernetes","développement local","tests locaux","conteneurs","docker","containerd","CRI-O","cluster kubernetes","outils de développement"],"de":["minikube","kubernetes","lokale Entwicklung","lokale Tests","Container","Docker","containerd","CRI-O","Kubernetes-Cluster","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["minikube","kubernetes","desenvolvimento de aplicações","teste de aplicações","cluster local","runtimes de contêiner","addons","homebrew","download direto"],"ru":["minikube","kubernetes","разработка приложений","тестирование приложений","локальный кластер","контейнерные runtime","аддоны","homebrew","прямая загрузка"],"ar":["ميني كيوب","كيوبيرنتس","تطوير التطبيقات","اختبار التطبيقات","مجموعة محلية","زمن تشغيل الحاويات","إضافات البرنامج","هومبريو","تحميل مباشر"]}},"owner":"anasahmed07","repo":"doit","repoPath":"anasahmed07/doit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.758Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"minikube","description":"Manages local Kubernetes clusters using Minikube for development and testing. This skill should be used when setting up local K8s environments, enabling addons, configuring networking, and deploying applications locally. Use this skill for Phase IV local Kubernetes deployments before cloud deployment.","bodyPreview":"# Minikube Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nMinikube runs a single-node Kubernetes cluster locally for development and testing. It supports multiple container runtimes (Docker, containerd, CRI-O) and provides easy addon management.\n\n## Installation\n\n### macOS\n```bash\n# Homebrew\nbrew install minikube\n\n# Or direct download\ncurl -LO https://storage.googleapis.com/minikube/releases/latest/minikube-darwin-arm64\nsudo install minikube-darwin-arm64 /usr/local/bin/minikube\n```\n\n### Linux\n```bash\ncurl -LO https://stor","body":"# Minikube Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nMinikube runs a single-node Kubernetes cluster locally for development and testing. It supports multiple container runtimes (Docker, containerd, CRI-O) and provides easy addon management.\n\n## Installation\n\n### macOS\n```bash\n# Homebrew\nbrew install minikube\n\n# Or direct download\ncurl -LO https://storage.googleapis.com/minikube/releases/latest/minikube-darwin-arm64\nsudo install minikube-darwin-arm64 /usr/local/bin/minikube\n```\n\n### Linux\n```bash\ncurl -LO https://storage.googleapis.com/minikube/releases/latest/minikube-linux-amd64\nsudo install minikube-linux-amd64 /usr/local/bin/minikube\n```\n\n### Windows (WSL2)\n```bash\ncurl -LO https://storage.googleapis.com/minikube/releases/latest/minikube-linux-amd64\nsudo install minikube-linux-amd64 /usr/local/bin/minikube\n```\n\n## Essential Commands\n\n### Cluster Management\n\n```bash\n# Start cluster (uses Docker driver by default)\nminikube start\n\n# Start with specific resources\nminikube start --memory=8192 --cpus=4\n\n# Start with specific Kubernetes version\nminikube start --kubernetes-version=v1.28.0\n\n# Start with specific driver\nminikube start --driver=docker\n\n# Check cluster status\nminikube status\n\n# Stop cluster (preserves state)\nminikube stop\n\n# Delete cluster completely\nminikube delete\n\n# Delete all clusters and profiles\nminikube delete --all\n```\n\n### Multiple Profiles\n\n```bash\n# Create named cluster\nminikube start -p my-cluster\n\n# Switch between clusters\nminikube profile my-cluster\n\n# List all profiles\nminikube profile list\n\n# Delete specific profile\nminikube delete -p my-cluster\n```\n\n### Accessing the Cluster\n\n```bash\n# Open Kubernetes dashboard\nminikube dashboard\n\n# Get cluster IP\nminikube ip\n\n# SSH into the node\nminikube ssh\n\n# Access service via URL\nminikube service <service-name> --url\n\n# Open service in browser\nminikube service <service-name>\n```\n\n## Addons\n\nMinikube addons extend cluster functionality:\n\n### List and Enable Addons\n\n```bash\n# List all available addons\nminikube addons list\n\n# Enable addon\nminikube addons enable <addon-name>\n\n# Disable addon\nminikube addons disable <addon-name>\n```\n\n### Essential Addons for TaskFlow\n\n```bash\n# Ingress controller (REQUIRED for external access)\nminikube addons enable ingress\n\n# Ingress DNS (optional, for local DNS)\nminikube addons enable ingress-dns\n\n# Metrics server (for kubectl top)\nminikube addons enable metrics-server\n\n# Dashboard (web UI)\nminikube addons enable dashboard\n\n# Storage provisioner (for PVCs)\nminikube addons enable storage-provisioner\n\n# Registry (local container registry)\nminikube addons enable registry\n```\n\n### Full Setup for TaskFlow\n\n```bash\n# Start with sufficient resources\nminikube start --memory=8192 --cpus=4\n\n# Enable essential addons\nminikube addons enable ingress\nminikube addons enable metrics-server\nminikube addons enable storage-provisioner\nminikube addons enable dashboard\n```\n\n## Networking\n\n### Accessing Services\n\nThree ways to access services in Minikube:\n\n#### 1. NodePort Service\n```bash\n# Get service URL\nminikube service my-service --url\n# Returns: http://192.168.49.2:30080\n```\n\n#### 2. Minikube Tunnel (LoadBalancer)\n```bash\n# Run in separate terminal (requires sudo)\nminikube tunnel\n\n# Now LoadBalancer services get external IPs\nkubectl get svc\n# EXTERNAL-IP will show actual IP instead of <pending>\n```\n\n#### 3. Port Forwarding\n```bash\nkubectl port-forward svc/my-service 8080:80\n# Access at http://localhost:8080\n```\n\n### Ingress Setup\n\n```bash\n# Enable ingress addon\nminikube addons enable ingress\n\n# Get minikube IP\nminikube ip\n# Returns: 192.168.49.2\n\n# Add to /etc/hosts\necho \"$(minikube ip) taskflow.local\" | sudo tee -a /etc/hosts\n\n# Now access via: http://taskflow.local\n```\n\n## Using Local Docker Images\n\n### Load Image into Minikube\n\n```bash\n# Load from local Docker\nminikube image load my-image:tag\n\n# List images in Minikube\nminikube image list\n```\n\n### Build Directly in Minikube\n\n```bash\n# Point Docker CLI to Minikube''s Docker daemon\neval $(minikube docker-env)\n\n# Now docker build goes directly into Minikube\ndocker build -t my-app:local .\n\n# Use imagePullPolicy: Never in K8s manifests\n```\n\n### Reset Docker Environment\n\n```bash\n# Return to local Docker daemon\neval $(minikube docker-env -u)\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Set Default Memory/CPU\n\n```bash\nminikube config set memory 8192\nminikube config set cpus 4\nminikube config set driver docker\n```\n\n### View Configuration\n\n```bash\nminikube config view\n```\n\n## Debugging\n\n### Logs\n\n```bash\n# Minikube logs\nminikube logs\n\n# Follow logs\nminikube logs -f\n\n# Specific component logs\nminikube logs --file=kubelet\n```\n\n### Common Issues\n\n#### 1. Insufficient Resources\n```bash\n# Stop and restart with more resources\nminikube stop\nminikube start --memory=8192 --cpus=4\n```\n\n#### 2. Driver Issues\n```bash\n# Try different driver\nminikube delete\nminikube start --driver=docker\n```\n\n#### 3. Ingress Not Working\n```bash\n# Verify ingress addon is running\nkubectl get pods -n ingress-nginx\n\n# Check ingress controller logs\nkubectl logs -n ingress-nginx -l app.kubernetes.io/component=controller\n```\n\n#### 4. Services Not Accessible\n```bash\n# Check if tunnel is needed\nminikube tunnel  # Run in separate terminal\n\n# Or use NodePort\nminikube service <service-name>\n```\n\n## TaskFlow Deployment Workflow\n\n```bash\n# 1. Start Minikube\nminikube start --memory=8192 --cpus=4\n\n# 2. Enable addons\nminikube addons enable ingress\nminikube addons enable metrics-server\n\n# 3. Point to Minikube Docker\neval $(minikube docker-env)\n\n# 4. Build images locally\ndocker build -t taskflow/api:local ./packages/api\ndocker build -t taskflow/web:local ./web-dashboard\ndocker build -t taskflow/sso:local ./sso-platform\ndocker build -t taskflow/mcp-server:local ./packages/mcp-server\n\n# 5. Deploy with Helm\nhelm install taskflow ./helm/taskflow \\\n  --set api.image.tag=local \\\n  --set api.image.pullPolicy=Never \\\n  --set web.image.tag=local \\\n  --set web.image.pullPolicy=Never\n\n# 6. Start tunnel for LoadBalancer\nminikube tunnel\n\n# 7. Access application\nminikube service taskflow-web\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `minikube start` | Start cluster |\n| `minikube stop` | Stop cluster |\n| `minikube delete` | Delete cluster |\n| `minikube status` | Check status |\n| `minikube dashboard` | Open web UI |\n| `minikube addons list` | List addons |\n| `minikube service <svc>` | Access service |\n| `minikube tunnel` | Enable LoadBalancer |\n| `minikube ip` | Get cluster IP |\n| `minikube image load <img>` | Load Docker image |\n| `eval $(minikube docker-env)` | Use Minikube Docker |\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to `references/addons-guide.md` for detailed addon configurations.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:05:35.691Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing a local Kubernetes environment for development and testing.","zh":"非常适合需要本地Kubernetes环境用于开发和测试的DevOps代理。","ja":"開発とテストにローカルのKubernetes環境を必要とするDevOpsエージェントに最適です。","ko":"개발 및 테스트를 위해 로컬 Kubernetes 환경이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan un entorno de Kubernetes local para desarrollo y pruebas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''un environnement Kubernetes local pour le développement et les tests.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die ein lokales Kubernetes-Umgebung für Entwicklung und Testing benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que precisam de um ambiente Kubernetes local para desenvolvimento e teste.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым требуется локальная среда Kubernetes для разработки и тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ديف أوبس الذين يحتاجون إلى بيئة كوبيرنيتس المحلية للتنمية والاختبار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run a single-node Kubernetes cluster locally, supporting multiple container runtimes like Docker, containerd, and CRI-O, and providing easy addon management through Kubernetes protocols.","zh":"使代理能够在本地运行单节点Kubernetes集群，支持多种容器运行时如Docker、containerd和CRI-O，并通过Kubernetes协议提供方便的插件管理。","ja":"エージェントがローカルでシングルノードKubernetesクラスターを実行できるようにし、Docker、containerd、CRI-Oなどの複数のコンテナランタイムをサポートし、Kubernetesプロトコルを介してアドオン管理を容易にします。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬에서 단일 노드 Kubernetes 클러스터를 실행할 수 있도록 하며 Docker, containerd, CRI-O 등을 포함한 여러 컨테이너 런타임을 지원하며 Kubernetes 프로토콜을 통해 애드온 관리를 쉽게 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar un clúster de Kubernetes de un solo nodo de forma local, compatible con múltiples tiempos de ejecución de contenedores como Docker, containerd y CRI-O, y proporciona una fácil gestión de complementos a través de protocolos de Kubernetes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter un cluster Kubernetes à nœud unique en local, prenant en charge plusieurs runtime de conteneurs tels que Docker, containerd et CRI-O, et offrant une gestion facile des extensions via les protocoles Kubernetes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, einen Single-Node-Kubernetes-Cluster lokal auszuführen, der mehrere Container-Laufzeiten wie Docker, containerd und CRI-O unterstützt und eine einfache Addon-Verwaltung durch Kubernetes-Protokolle bietet.","pt":"Permite que os agentes executem um cluster Kubernetes de um único nó localmente, suportando vários tempos de execução de contêiner, como Docker, containerd e CRI-O, e fornecendo fácil gerenciamento de complementos por meio de protocolos Kubernetes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам запускать единый узел кластера Kubernetes локально, поддерживая несколько сред выполнения контейнеров, таких как Docker, containerd и CRI-O, и обеспечивая легкое управление дополнениями через протоколы Kubernetes.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتشغيل عنقود كوبيرنيتس من عقدة واحدة محليًا، ودعم وقت تشغيل حاويات متعددة مثل Docker و containerd و CRI-O، وتوفير إدارة ملحقات سهلة من خلال بروتوكولات Kubernetes."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying microservices for local testing","Debugging containerized applications","Testing Kubernetes configurations before deployment"],"zh":["为本地测试部署微服务","调试容器化应用程序","在部署之前测试Kubernetes配置"],"ja":["ローカルテスト用のマイクロサービスをデプロイする","コンテナ化されたアプリケーションをデバッグする","デプロイ前にKubernetes構成をテストする"],"ko":["로컬 테스트를 위한 마이크로 서비스 배포","컨테이너화된 애플리케이션 디버깅","배포 전 Kubernetes 구성 테스트"],"es":["Implementar microservicios para pruebas locales","Depurar aplicaciones contenerizadas","Probar configuraciones de Kubernetes antes de la implementación"],"fr":["Déployer des microservices pour des tests locaux","Déboguer des applications conteneurisées","Tester des configurations Kubernetes avant le déploiement"],"de":["Microservices für lokale Tests bereitstellen","Containerisierte Anwendungen debuggen","Kubernetes-Konfigurationen vor der Bereitstellung testen"],"pt":["Implantação de microsserviços para teste local","Depuração de aplicações contêinerizadas","Teste de configurações Kubernetes antes da implantação"],"ru":["Развертывание микросервисов для локального тестирования","Отладка контейнеризированных приложений","Тестирование конфигураций Kubernetes перед развертыванием"],"ar":["نشر خدمات μικro للاختبار المحلي","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الحاويات","اختبار تكوينات Kubernetes قبل النشر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires sufficient local resources to run a Kubernetes cluster","Limited to a single-node cluster","Supports specific container runtimes only"],"zh":["需要足够的本地资源来运行Kubernetes集群","仅限单节点集群","仅支持特定的容器运行时"],"ja":["Kubernetesクラスターを実行するために十分なローカルリソースが必要","シングルノードクラスターのみ","特定のコンテナランタイムのみをサポート"],"ko":["Kubernetes 클러스터를 실행하기 위해 충분한 로컬 리소스가 필요","단일 노드 클러스터만 해당","특정 컨테이너 런타임만 지원"],"es":["Requiere recursos locales suficientes para ejecutar un clúster de Kubernetes","Limitado a un clúster de un solo nodo","Solo admite tiempos de ejecución de contenedores específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite des ressources locales suffisantes pour exécuter un cluster Kubernetes","Limité à un cluster à nœud unique","Ne prend en charge que des runtime de conteneurs spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt ausreichende lokale Ressourcen, um einen Kubernetes-Cluster auszuführen","Begrenzt auf einen Single-Node-Cluster","Unterstützt nur bestimmte Container-Laufzeiten"],"pt":["Requer recursos locais suficientes para executar um cluster Kubernetes","Limitado a um cluster de um único nó","Suporta apenas tempos de execução de contêiner específicos"],"ru":["Требует достаточных локальных ресурсов для запуска кластера Kubernetes","Ограничен единым узлом кластера","Поддерживает только определенные среды выполнения контейнеров"],"ar":["يتطلب موارد محلية كافية لتشغيل عنقود كوبيرنيتس","محدود بعنقود عقدة واحدة","دعم وقت تشغيل حاويات محددة فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f409094ab18876d8c9e56e445b1d8bf812d8cfd75b534451c9efaba1b6827d68","qualityScore":36}');
