INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('anasahmed07/doit/minikube', 'minikube', 'anasahmed07', 'doit', 'community', 'minikube anasahmed07 doit community Minikube runs a local Kubernetes cluster for development and testing, supporting multiple container runtimes. It benefits developers and testers who need a local environment. Minikube 是一个用于运行单节点 Kubernetes 集群的工具，支持多种容器运行时 Minikube はシングルノード Kubernetes クラスターを実行するためのツールで、複数のコンテナランタイムをサポート Minikube는 단일 노드 Kubernetes 클러스터를 실행하는 도구로, 여러 컨테이너 런타임을 지원 Minikube es una herramienta para ejecutar clústeres de Kubernetes de un solo nodo de forma local para pruebas y desarrollo Minikube est un outil pour exécuter des clusters Kubernetes à un seul nœud en local pour les tests et le développement Minikube ist ein Tool zum Ausführen von Kubernetes-Clustern mit einem einzigen Knoten für lokale Tests und Entwicklung O Minikube é uma ferramenta para executar clusters Kubernetes locais para desenvolvimento e teste. Minikube - это инструмент для запуска локальных кластеров Kubernetes для разработки и тестирования. ميني كيوب هو أداة لتشغيل مجموعات كيوبيرنتس المحلية للاستخدامات التطويرية والاختبارية how to use minikube minikube installation guide minikube vs k3s minikube setup for developers what is minikube minikube alternative minikube local Kubernetes cluster minikube install on macOS minikube install on Linux Minikube Kubernetes 本地开发环境 容器运行时 Docker containerd CRI-O macOS Linux Homebrew Supports multiple container runtimes including Docker, containerd, and CRI-O Provides easy addon management for customized cluster setup Can be installed on macOS using Homebrew or direct download Can be installed on Linux using curl and manual installation Runs a single-node Kubernetes cluster locally for development and testing Supports various Kubernetes features for local development minikube is a tool that runs a single-node Kubernetes cluster locally for development and testing purposes.');
